    "world": {
        "_comment": "The engine's world block. Fenn Lusk owns the wagon (an NPC owner): any Blade moves it on along his route and calls the night. The contract is made on the fair's last evening at Saltmouth; the route goes up the river road (twelve miles to the Millbeck bridge, eight more to Wendford, a long day) and then the slope track to the Highsteads (eight miles of hill). With the night at Saltmouth and one on the way, the wagon reaches the Highsteads on the contract's third day. On a next contract the clock carries on from the saved day and the day limit counts from the contract's first day.",
